# Force LF in the repository and on checkout, on every platform.
# Without this, a clone on a machine with core.autocrlf=true rewrites every
# source file to CRLF. That is not cosmetic here: connect verifies its embedded
# copy of this package with a SHA-256 of the source, so a line-ending flip
# breaks the staleness gate, and a published npm tarball should never carry
# platform-dependent bytes.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
